# Icon categories in icons/
# Each folder mirrors hicolor's structure.
# Raster: 1024x1024+ and square — scaled to every hicolor size, ~15 PNGs.
# Vector: any SVG — copied once to hicolor/scalable/<category>/, no scaling.
# Install with `manager.py → 4 → 1`.

/apps            — application launchers
/categories      — app category icons
/devices         — hardware device icons
/emblems         — overlay / badge icons
/mimetypes       — file type association icons
/panel           — panel / taskbar icons
/status          — status indicator icons

# Current icons:
#   apps/neovim.svg   — Neovim logo (vector, 602x734 → installed to scalable/apps/)
